225
00:08:51,370 --> 00:08:53,216
go back to an earlier point or to a

226
00:08:53,216 --> 00:08:55,094
different point all in the same session

227
00:08:55,142 --> 00:08:56,987
without starting new sessions. And you can

228
00:08:57,051 --> 00:09:00,243
