229
00:09:00,259 --> 00:09:02,407
something, to bring the core insights you

230
00:09:02,503 --> 00:09:05,902
gained in one exploration to another branch

231
00:09:05,902 --> 00:09:08,210
in the same session as we did it here where

232
00:09:08,210 --> 00:09:10,134
we have that summary that includes all the

233
00:09:10,134 --> 00:09:12,154
details, what happened and some information

234
00:09:12,154 --> 00:09:14,446
