237
00:09:20,393 --> 00:09:21,002
used to it.

238
00:09:21,595 --> 00:09:23,535
It's just important to keep in mind that

239
00:09:23,583 --> 00:09:26,116
using tree will never change your code files

240
00:09:26,244 --> 00:09:29,130
or any other files. It only moves around in

241
00:09:29,130 --> 00:09:29,979
that conversation.

242
00:09:31,092 --> 00:09:33,262
But with that, we can now, for example, here

243
00:09:34,023 --> 00:09:35,107
implement that plan

244
00:09:35,804 --> 00:09:38,281
pointing at that new plan file that was

245
00:09:38,313 --> 00:09:41,168
created. And we do that in this new branch

246
00:09:41,168 --> 00:09:41,314
now.

247
00:09:41,948 --> 00:09:44,762
So here it's done, it implemented this plan.

248
00:09:46,452 --> 00:09:47,690
And therefore, of course, I can start that

249
00:09:47,820 --> 00:09:50,361
dev server again. And now if I visit this,

250
00:09:52,060 --> 00:09:52,223
I can

251
00:09:52,992 --> 00:09:54,367
post a message, of course, but I can now

252
00:09:54,367 --> 00:09:56,867
also browse users and see my feed. But of

