262
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,251
If I unfollow,

263
00:10:21,991 --> 00:10:23,742
that message is gone. And of course that

264
00:10:23,742 --> 00:10:25,786
would also work in the other direction.

265
00:10:26,824 --> 00:10:28,618
But the most important feature, of course,

266
00:10:28,925 --> 00:10:30,929
is Py's tree feature, which you now saw in

267
00:10:30,945 --> 00:10:31,171
action.
